{
    "name": "Cerebro Híbrido (Mistral + Reglas) - v3",
    "nodes": [
        {
            "parameters": {
                "httpMethod": "POST",
                "path": "chat",
                "responseMode": "responseNode",
                "options": {}
            },
            "name": "Webhook",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                400,
                300
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "conditions": {
                    "string": [
                        {
                            "value1": "={{ $json.body.message }}",
                            "operation": "startsWith",
                            "value2": "intent_"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            },
            "name": "Es un Botón?",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                620,
                300
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "// RESPUESTAS RÁPIDAS (Sin gastar AI)\nconst msg = $json.body.message;\nlet timeline = [];\n\nif (msg === 'intent_avocados') {\n  timeline = [\n    { type: 'text', content: '🥑 ¡Nuestros Hass son mantequilla pura!' },\n    { type: 'products', items: [{ id: 'hass-24', name: 'Caja de 24 unidades hass mediano', price: 16600, image: 'https://tus-aguacates.vercel.app/images/avatar-aguacate.png' }] },\n    { type: 'options', options: [{ label: '🛒 Agregar', value: 'add_hass_24' }, { label: 'Volver', value: 'greeting' }] }\n  ];\n} else if (msg === 'intent_market') {\n  timeline = [\n    { type: 'text', content: '🧺 Mercado fresco para toda la semana.' },\n    { type: 'products', items: [{ id: 'hass-12-premium', name: 'Caja de 12 unidades Premium', price: 24700, image: 'https://tus-aguacates.vercel.app/images/hero-optimized.png' }] }\n  ];\n} else {\n  // Default fallback for buttons\n  timeline = [{ type: 'text', content: 'Entendido.' }];\n}\n\nreturn { timeline };"
            },
            "name": "Respuesta Estática",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                900,
                180
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "text": "={{ $json.body.message }}",
                "options": {
                    "systemMessage": "Eres el Mayordomo de 'Tus Aguacates'.\n\nTU TAREA:\nResponder preguntas sobre aguacates, frutas y recetas.\n\nFORMATO OBLIGATORIO (JSON):\nNo respondas texto plano. Responde SIEMPRE este JSON:\n{ \"timeline\": [ { \"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"Respuesta...\" } ] }\n\nSI TE PIDEN PRODUCTOS:\nUsa los siguientes datos reales:\n- Aguacate Hass Media (Malla x5): $18.000 (ID: hass-x5-real)\n- Combo Familiar: $85.000 (ID: combo-fam-real)\n\nEjemplo JSON con producto:\n{ \"timeline\": [ { \"type\": \"products\", \"items\": [{ \"id\": \"hass-x5-real\", \"name\": \"Aguacate Hass\", \"price\": 18000, \"image\": \"https://tus-aguacates.vercel.app/images/avatar-aguacate.png\" }] } ] }"
                }
            },
            "name": "AI Agent (Mistral)",
            "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                900,
                450
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "model": "mistral-small-latest",
                "options": {}
            },
            "name": "Mistral Model",
            "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatMistralCloud",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                900,
                650
            ],
            "credentials": {
                "mistralCloudApi": {
                    "id": "xxCUooDM4wFtCGFv",
                    "name": "Mistral Cloud account"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "options": {}
            },
            "name": "Respond to Webhook",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                1300,
                300
            ]
        }
    ],
    "connections": {
        "Webhook": {
            "main": [
                [
                    {
                        "node": "Es un Botón?",
                        "type": "main",
                        "index": 0
                    }
                ]
            ]
        },
        "Es un Botón?": {
            "main": [
                [
                    {
